# uniq(1)

## NAME

uniq - report or omit repeated lines

## SYNOPSIS

    uniq [-cdui] [input [output]]

## DESCRIPTION

Writes the input with adjacent equal lines merged into one. Lines that are not adjacent are not merged, so sort first.

## OPTIONS

- `-c`: prefix the number of occurrences
- `-d`: only repeated lines
- `-u`: only lines that are not repeated
- `-i`: ignore case

## SEE ALSO

sort(1)
